# Annotations on a diagram: a brace along a column (on the side away from its arrows), a cross, a check.
title "Which is right?"
schema graph
mark g1 box guess label="2 + 2 = 5"
mark g2 box guess label="2 + 2 = 4"
mark x1 box input label="x₁"
mark x2 box input label="x₂"
mark x3 box input label="x₃"
mark h box output label="sum"
link l1 arrow x1 -> h
link l2 arrow x2 -> h
link l3 arrow x3 -> h
mark n brace of=[x1,x2,x3] label="3 inputs"
mark no cross of=g1
mark yes check of=g2 label="right"
Say: "Pick one."
